  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING CHANGE AND RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women&#x2019;s Rights Programme in Nepal, implemented by ActionAid and local partners aims to contribute to the reduction of GBV. The main objective is to improve gender responsive public services through progressive policies and mechanisms that will enhance security and safety of women and girls. Objective: Improved gender responsive public service and established supportive policies and mechanisms to ensure safety, security for women and girls at local and national levels. Outcome: Reduced Risk of GBV of marginalized women and girls as well as survivors of violence through collective actions, empowerment and system engagement</narrative>
  </description>
